### ========================================
### 微店导入功能测试
### ========================================
###

### 变量定义
@categoryId = 替换为实际的分类ID

### 测试 28: 从微店导入商品（完整流程 - 通过 URL）
# @name importFromWeidian
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/import-from-weidian
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://weidian.com/item.html?itemID=6900807244",
  "slug": "nike-air-max-90-black-test",
  "primaryCategoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "title": "Nike Air Max 90 Black",
  "description": "经典复古跑鞋，黑色配色",
  "aiAttributes": {
    "colors": ["黑色", "白色"],
    "materials": ["皮革", "网布"],
    "gender": "unisex",
    "styles": ["复古", "运动"]
  },
  "status": "draft"
}

### 测试 29: 从微店导入商品（通过 itemId + 指定品牌）
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/import-from-weidian
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemId": "6900807244",
  "brandId": "{{brandId}}",
  "slug": "test-product-with-brand",
  "primaryCategoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "status": "draft"
}

### 测试 30: 从微店导入商品（自动创建品牌）
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/import-from-weidian
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://weidian.com/item.html?itemID=6900807244",
  "brandName": "Test Brand Auto Create",
  "slug": "test-auto-brand-creation",
  "primaryCategoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "status": "draft"
}

### 测试 31: 从微店导入商品（强制刷新缓存）
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/import-from-weidian
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemId": "6900807244",
  "slug": "test-force-refresh",
  "primaryCategoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "forceRefresh": true,
  "status": "draft"
}

### 测试 32: 从微店导入商品（多副分类）
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/import-from-weidian
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemId": "6900807244",
  "slug": "test-multiple-categories",
  "primaryCategoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "secondaryCategoryIds": ["副分类ID1", "副分类ID2"],
  "status": "active",
  "isFeatured": true
}

### 测试 33: 查看导入的商品详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{importFromWeidian.response.body.product.id}}

### 测试 34: 查看导入商品的 SKU 列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{importFromWeidian.response.body.product.id}}/skus

### 测试 35: 获取所有商品列表（查看导入结果）
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

